  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\nIntransitive pair: {入|い}れ{替|か}わる (to be replaced, to change places)\n\nUSAGE:\n- 〜を{入|い}れ{替|か}える (to replace/swap ~)\n- AとBを{入|い}れ{替|か}える (to swap A and B)\n- {電池|でんち}を{入|い}れ{替|か}える (replace batteries)\n- {選手|せんしゅ}を{入|い}れ{替|か}える (substitute players)\n- {順番|じゅんばん}を{入|い}れ{替|か}える (change order)\n- {衣替|ころもが}え (seasonal clothing change)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {入|い}れ{替|か}わる (intransitive: to switch places)\n- {取|と}り{替|か}える (to exchange)\n- {置|お}き{換|か}える (to replace, substitute)",
